# "If it was cast": Doomsday Excruciator put into the battlefield from the graveyard with Reanimate (Entomb put it there) was
# not cast, so no library is touched (CR 603.4): Bot1's library keeps all its cards and Bot2's too; nothing is exiled. Bot1
# pays 6 life for Reanimate (its mana value). Its upkeep draw still happens: at turn 3 the library (12 after Entomb) shrinks by one
# for the upkeep trigger and one for the draw step: 10.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dark Ritual
Entomb
Reanimate
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Doomsday Excruciator
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Doomsday Excruciator)
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Doomsday Excruciator)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Doomsday Excruciator
? Exile.Count = 0
? Bot1.Life = 14
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Library.Count = 10
? Bot2.Library.Count = 8

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Library.Count = 8
Bot1.Life = 14
